Another minor update today, two items:


 Fixing a problem where the "Start Resumable Game" button was greyed out when you were waiting for a live match. It should only be greyed out when you are at your limit of resumable games (15 games). This button should now be enabled correctly;
 Tweaking the logging file to help me narrow down some issues a user is having.

